ffe.  Handwritten in black ink, on a faded gummed paper label with a red border, are the words: Raw Sienna - Asolo. The black metal lid has slight abrasions and scratches and the jar of pigment is 1/2 full.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Artist(s)","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_artist"}],"content":"Asolo","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Copyright","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_copyright"}],"content":"© Unknown","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Measurement Description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/measurement_description"}],"content":"6 1/2 x 2 1/2 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"credit line","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026687"}],"content":"Gift of Juan and Anna Marie Hamilton","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}